    <section>
      <para>For 1 - 6, use the following information to complete the table. Show the predicted number of downloads at each listed price. The first row has been completed for you.</para>
      <para>
        <quote>A company that sells movies online is deciding how much to charge customers to download a new movie. Based on data from previous sales, the company predicts that if they charge \(x\) dollars for each download, then the number of downloads, in thousands, is \(18-x\).</quote>
    </para>
